Subject: [PATCH] DRM PRIME: route interlaced native SC2 surfaces through field-rate EI

Keep progressive Request HEVC/AV1 unchanged. The SC2-only hardware filter
produces two progressive DRM PRIME outputs and carries their actual PTS.
Destroy the filter graph at seek to abort DMA and drop queued fields;
exported downstream buffers keep their independent lifetime. No MA/MC claim.
Carry completed field durations through an explicit VideoPicture flag honored
by the player, including streams without PTS/DTS. Progressive timing is unchanged.

